1247 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Standard Chartered Bank \055 Lead UX\057UI Designer \050Contract via Nuaav\051                                                                                  Apr 2026 \055 Present\nLed end\055to\055end product design for a 6\055agent AI platform for Relationship Managers\054 translating complex client intelligence\054 portfolio rebalancing\054 and CRM workflows into a unified experience projected to improve workflow efficiency by \17637\045\073 prototype secured executive approval for a 15\055user pilot\056\nBuilt functional React prototypes using Figma MCP and Claude Code\054 translating complex agent orchestration and deterministic logic into interactive testbeds to validate workflows and de\055risk interactions before production\056\nDesigned a transparent AI audit and evaluation system that traces generated recommendations to bank policy clauses\054 giving Relationship Managers visibility into agent reasoning and supporting human\055in\055the\055loop review\056\n\nTashvi\056ai \055 Co\055Founder \046 Lead Product Designer                                                                                                               Mar 2025 \055 May 2026\nTook an AI\055native product from 0\2221\054 leading product strategy\054 UX\054 prototyping\054 and launch of a responsive jewelry design platform that grew to 10\054000\053 users and \04450K ARR within 6 months\056\nRan continuous customer discovery and A\057B testing across generative AI workflows\054 reducing design\055pipeline drop\055off by 22\045 and establishing rapid user\055feedback loops\056\nBuilt a scalable Figma design system and used Cursor \053 Claude Code to move directly from design into functional React prototypes and production\055ready frontend workflows\056\nArrive \055 Sr\056 UX Researcher \050Contract via Craft\051                                                                                                                       Jul 2025 \055 Dec 2025\nLed customer discovery and strategic workshops with Product and Sales leadership across North America and Europe\054 translating research into a 2\055year B2B product vision for a \0441B mobility platform and aligning cross\055functional roadmaps around validated customer needs\056\nOwned end\055to\055end research across 25\053 customer interviews spanning fleet management and expense workflows\054 rapidly synthesizing findings into high\055fidelity concepts and prototypes used to validate product direction\056\nZoomInfo \055 UX\057UI Designer II                                                                                                                                                      May 2022 \055 Apr 2024\nRedesigned complex enterprise search workflows for SalesOS into a conversational AI\055driven discovery experience\054 validating the hybrid chat\055and\055filter interaction through usability testing with an 87\045 preference rate and 27\045 faster search\056\nCo\055led a design task force to unify the setup of 12 distinct products into a centralized enterprise admin platform\056 Interviewed 50\053 internal PMs and designers to map legacy feature nuances\054 distilling multi\055team provisioning workflows into a streamlined one\055time configuration\054 increasing day\055zero customer satisfaction by 32\045\056\nScaled Muze\054 ZoomInfo\047s Design System with 1\054000\053 components\054 establishing reusable interaction patterns and WCAG 2\0561 AA standards across product teams\056\nJohnson \046 Johnson \055 UX Designer \050Contract via JK Design\051                                                                                            Jun 2021 \055 Feb 2022\nDesigned and validated high\055fidelity experiences for J\046J\047s global ESG reporting platform\054 achieving a 90\045 navigation preference in usability testing\056\nExpanded the enterprise design system with 30\053 reusable\054 WCAG 2\0561 AA\055compliant components\054 enabling future annual reports to reuse established patterns and reducing repeated design and development effort\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
